==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Origin|Ariados|113}} from the {{TCG|Lost Origin}} expansion.
*'''Bind Down''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Majestic Dawn|Leafeon|7}} from the {{TCG|Majestic Dawn}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

